messages.content:
依赖：npm/axios 1.7.4；服务暴露面：internet
漏洞：CVE-2026-44496
漏洞函数：axios.create, axios.get, axios.post, axios.request, axios/unsafe/helpers/cookies.js read, document.cookie, name
触发条件：浏览器环境中，应用将攻击者可控的 xsrfCookieName 配置传给 axios 请求或直接调用 unsafe cookie helper，axios 读取 document.cookie 时构造未转义正则导致 ReDoS。

<data>
静态命中位置：
### src/preview.js:5
const express = require('express');
const axios = require('axios');

const app = express();
const internal = axios.create({ baseURL: 'http://10.0.0.8:8080', headers: { 'X-Internal-Token': process.env.TOKEN } });

// 前端传入 path，服务端代为请求内部接口再把结果返回
app.get('/proxy', async (req, res) => {
  const { data } = await internal.get(req.query.path);

### src/preview.js:8
